# keeps the Messenger home: no loot, hand still the two Islands and the Forest drawn for the turn. On turn 4 Bot2's Faerie Miscreant attacks - not a Faerie
# Bot1 controls, no loot either; Bot1 only drew for its turns (library 12 after turn 5).

